DESCRIPTION:~25 min. No bags allowed\, only small clear bags or phone walle
 ts\; paid bag storage available.\n\n🚗 Getting there: about 25 min drive
  from Hotel Renew (20 km)\n\n📍 Pearl Harbor Visitor Center\, 1 Arizona 
 Memorial Pl\, Honolulu\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destin
 ation=Pearl%20Harbor%20Visitor%20Center
