  on Recreation.gov\; book the earliest slot. Includes a film and boat ride
 \, ~75 min.\n\n🚗 Getting there: about 2 min drive from Pearl Harbor Vis
 itor Center (~1.7 km\, estimated)\n\n📍 USS Arizona Memorial\, Pearl Har
 bor (official boat only)\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&dest
 ination=USS%20Arizona%20Memorial\nRecreation.gov reservations: https://www
 .recreation.gov/ticket/facility/233338
