DESCRIPTION:After the aviation museum\, shuttle back to the visitor center\
 , then Uber ~25 min\, arriving around 16:00.\n\n🚗 Getting there: about 
 35 min drive from Pearl Harbor Aviation Museum (~24 km\, estimated)\n\n
 📍 Hotel Renew\, 129 Paoakalani Ave\, Honolulu\, 129 Paoakalani Ave\, Ho
 nolulu\, HI 96815\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination
 =Hotel%20Renew%2C%20129%20Paoakalani%20Ave%2C%20Honolulu
