BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:oahu-2027-jan-five-nights-d2-7@travel-plan
DTSTAMP:20261119T195527Z
DTSTART:20270105T023000Z
DTEND:20270105T050000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ Backup: Waikīkī sunset sail
DESCRIPTION:The sunset sail can be today or Jan 7: check the weather and se
 a conditions before the trip and pick whichever day is calmer with fewer c
 louds. If today\, be at the beach boarding spot at 16:30\, sailing 17:00
 –19:00\; you'll still be adjusting to the time change\, so if you're tir
 ed save it for Jan 7. No sail? Stroll Kūhiō Beach and watch the sunset (
 ~18:05 in January).\n\n🚶 Getting there: about 10 min walk from Hotel Re
 new\n\n📍 Kūhiō Beach\, Honolulu\, Kalākaua Ave\, Waikīkī\n🧭 htt
 ps://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=K%C5%ABhi%C5%8D%20Beach%2C
 %20Honolulu\nBook Moana Sailing: https://www.hawaiiactivities.com/en/hawai
 i/oahu/a/166886
LOCATION:Kūhiō Beach\, Honolulu\, Kalākaua Ave\, Waikīkī
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=K%C5%ABhi%C5%8D%20Be
 ach%2C%20Honolulu
GEO:21.275;-157.82694
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="Kalākaua Ave, Waikīkī";
 X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Kūhiō Beach, Honolulu":geo:21.275,-157.82694
END:VEVENT
