SUMMARY:🍽️ Dinner: Duke's Waikiki
DESCRIPTION:Oceanfront\; fish and Hula Pie. Reserve ahead\; if you sail tod
 ay\, book 19:15.\n\n🚶 Getting there: about 4 min walk from Kūhiō Beac
 h\n\n📍 Duke's Waikiki\, 2335 Kalākaua Ave\, Honolulu\n🧭 https://www
 .google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Duke's%20Waikiki
LOCATION:Duke's Waikiki\, 2335 Kalākaua Ave\, Honolulu
