DTSTAMP:20261119T195527Z
DTSTART:20270105T181500Z
DTEND:20270105T190000Z
SUMMARY:🚗 Pick up the car in Waikīkī
DESCRIPTION:Bring your G licence and credit card\; inspect the car and take
  photos. Clockwise loop today: the northeast valleys first\, then back alo
 ng the North Shore.\n\n📍 Waikīkī rental office (sample location)\, Ka
 lākaua Ave\, east end\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destin
 ation=Waik%C4%ABk%C4%AB%20rental%20office%20(sample%20location)
LOCATION:Waikīkī rental office (sample location)\, Kalākaua Ave\, east e
 nd
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Waik%C4%ABk%C4%AB%20
 rental%20office%20(sample%20location)
