DTSTAMP:20261119T195527Z
DTSTART:20270106T035000Z
DTEND:20270106T044000Z
SUMMARY:🛍️ Waikele Premium Outlets
DESCRIPTION:~20 min from Dole via H-2. Shop for ~50 min only\; if you run l
 ate at Dole\, skip it and go straight to Ko Olina for dinner.\n\n🚗 Gett
 ing there: about 20 min drive from Dole Plantation (20 km)\n\n📍 Waikele
  Premium Outlets\, 94-790 Lumiaina St\, Waipahu\, HI 96797\n🧭 https://w
 ww.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Waikele%20Premium%20Outlets\nOut
 lets official site: https://www.premiumoutlets.com/outlet/waikele
LOCATION:Waikele Premium Outlets\, 94-790 Lumiaina St\, Waipahu\, HI 96797
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Waikele%20Premium%20
 Outlets
GEO:21.4017617;-158.0068567
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="94-790 Lumiaina St, Waipah
 u, HI 96797";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Waikele Premium Outlets":geo:21.4
 017617,-158.0068567
END:VEVENT
