DTSTAMP:20261119T195527Z
DTSTART:20270106T050000Z
DTEND:20270106T055000Z
SUMMARY:🍽️ Ko Olina dinner
DESCRIPTION:~18 min drive from the outlets (~35 min straight from Dole). Ea
 t inside the Ko Olina resort area\, e.g. Monkeypod Kitchen\; reservations 
 recommended.\n\n🚗 Getting there: about 20 min drive from Waikele Premiu
 m Outlets (17 km)\n\n📍 Four Seasons Resort Oahu at Ko Olina\, 92-1001 O
 lani St\, Kapolei\, HI 96707\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&
 destination=Four%20Seasons%20Resort%20Oahu%20at%20Ko%20Olina
LOCATION:Four Seasons Resort Oahu at Ko Olina\, 92-1001 Olani St\, Kapolei\
 , HI 96707
URL:https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=Four%20Seasons%20Res
 ort%20Oahu%20at%20Ko%20Olina
GEO:21.3392955;-158.125741
X-APPLE-STRUCTURED-LOCATION;VALUE=URI;X-ADDRESS="92-1001 Olani St, Kapolei,
  HI 96707";X-APPLE-RADIUS=100;X-TITLE="Four Seasons Resort Oahu at Ko Olin
 a":geo:21.3392955,-158.125741
