DTSTART:20270107T233000Z
DTEND:20270108T023000Z
SUMMARY:📸 Green Line to the Diamond Head lookout
DESCRIPTION:The Green Line (Diamond Head Line) has a photo stop at Kahala L
 ookout\; step off and you'll see Diamond Head and the ocean\, no hiking. A
  loop takes ~70 min\, and the last afternoon run heads back from the Diamo
 nd Head area around 15:10–15:40\, so don't set out too late. Not going i
 nto the crater: that needs a separate state park reservation\, and without
  the summit there isn't much to see.\n\n🚗 Getting there: about 5 min dr
 ive from Hotel Renew (~3.3 km\, estimated)\n\n📍 Diamond Head Lookout\, 
 Diamond Head Rd\, Honolulu\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&de
 stination=Diamond%20Head%20Lookout%2C%20Diamond%20Head%20Rd%2C%20Honolulu\
 nGreen Line schedule and stops: https://waikikitrolley.com/green-line/
