DTSTART:20270108T030000Z
DTEND:20270108T050000Z
SUMMARY:🎟️ Waikīkī sunset sail (or move to Jan 4)
DESCRIPTION:E.g. Moana Sailing's 2-hour sail (~USD81/person\, one drink inc
 luded)\; Manu Kai's 1.5-hour happy hour ~USD56/person. January sunset is ~
 18:05\, and heading back after dark you'll see Waikīkī and Diamond Head 
 lit up. Operators may cancel in rough seas. The sail can also go on the ev
 ening of Jan 4: check the forecast before the trip and pick the calmer\, l
 ess cloudy day\; if you already sailed on Jan 4\, just watch the sunset fr
 om the beach and eat early.\n\n📍 Kūhiō Beach\, Honolulu\, Kalākaua A
 ve\, Waikīkī\n🧭 https://www.google.com/maps/dir/?api=1&destination=K%
 C5%ABhi%C5%8D%20Beach%2C%20Honolulu\nBook Moana Sailing: https://www.hawai
 iactivities.com/en/hawaii/oahu/a/166886
